  "_comment": "Test vectors for text (values.md §5 to §8). Each string is given as JSON, with escapes for the characters that are not visible. text and multiline_text tell whether it is text and multi-line text; blank, whether each of its code points is in the list of values.md §7; length, its number of code points.",

